    - target: {fileID: 114423615070296514, guid: 25c8198cf47fa754fac36bbeb948e71a,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: flavorText
      value: Welcome to the Bridge to Nowhere. Construction on the bridge started
        in 1936 but was stopped in 1938 when people noticed there was no land in
        the direction the bridge was being built.  In 1943 the town started to advertise
        the bridge as a tourist attraction and ever since it has brought in thousands
        of people from around the world to marvel at the unfinished municipal project.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114423615070296514, guid: 25c8198cf47fa754fac36bbeb948e71a,
